y if surgery is needed\n- Long-term disability is unlikely to be needed for cubital tunnel syndrome with appropriate treatment\n\n6. **Vocational Rehabilitation**:\n- Referral to vocational rehabilitation counselor if job modification is insufficient\n- Technology solutions: Voice-to-text programming tools, eye-tracking interfaces, specialized input devices\n- Most software programmers can return to full productivity with appropriate accommodations and treatment',
